  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="6d979b10-635f-53e2-8daf-1f5dd9883dd5" activityNameId="874c334b-2888-505a-b8e9-b53a648b328c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Photovoltaic cell, single-Si, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Photovoltaic cell, single-Si, at plant
Production of photovoltaic cells (156.75x156.75 mm2). Some inputs and emissions aggregated to protect sensitive data.;
Synonyms: monocrystalline, single crystalline, silicon; 
UUID: 7e7b3a17-7ab3-3d6e-a05c-79fbde9d167b
Cleaning, damage etching, texture etching, covering of backside, phosphor dotation, phosphor glass etching, printing of contacts, cleaning and quality testing.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average production technology of photovoltaic cells from wafers.
Time period: Data investigated in 2004. Demand of electricity and metallisation paste updated for 2018.
Production volume: Approximately 105000 MW for total c-Si in 2018
Sampling: Data collected from 5 specific processes and companies (4 multi-Si + 1 single-Si processing company). 
Extrapolations: Data 2005 calculated from data 2004 by multiplying amounts of materials by solar cell area factor of 156*156/(125*125) = 1.56; energy scaled linearly with cell side length. Extrapolation of European LCI inventory data by adjusting the electricity mix.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7e7b3a17-7ab3-3d6e-a05c-79fbde9d167b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="3142d8e2-0d30-557e-b090-9faae2b72357" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
